<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta share index up 1.06 pct on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>Jakarta share index up 1.06 pct on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta Composite Index rose 1.06 percent to 593.59 points after 30 minutes of trading on Thursday on foreign buying of selected big-capitalised stocks and bank counters, brokers said.</p>
</text>
